      "value": "@{5c075935d5cece4df39f010f|full_name}: Because you no longer need to fight the physics to get thrown in a particular direction it is as simple as putting a cube under your avatar with no rotation. This was a setup on my old flying avatar that would pull me down in previous vrchat versions. It now acts more consistently as if you are walking and jumping on the ground.\n\nI have not done any more testing in build 722 but I assume an angled collider behind you could result in more speed when jumping.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
