      "mergeID": "5ce039a9f94244401377d5a8",
      "mergedPostDetails": "After updating the February 2, 2019 version, the avatar could not fly normally.",
      "mergedPostTitle": "Avatar can't fly",
      "parentID": null,
      "pinned": false,
      "postDeleted": false,
      "postID": "5cdd545b6c3a7114478596dd",
      "private": false,
      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I had this update also break my flying avatars. It flies extremely slow and it randomly pumps it back really fast at times. I think they changed avatar bounds in someway. Would be nice if they told us how they changed them exactly so we can edit our flying avatars appropriately",
